			"notes": "### Sky\n\n1. Sunrise/sunset horizon glow recolored with a custom warm gradient (deep red > orange > gold)\n2. Overall sky color tints toward deep red during sunrise/sunset, not just the horizon band\n3. Daytime sky color saturation boosted, fading out smoothly as dusk approaches\n\n### Stars\n\n1. Star count increased from 1,500 → 6,000\n2. Star brightness boosted (fades in stronger, earlier into dusk)\n\n### Weather\n\n1. Rain now adds extra fog on top of vanilla's rain fog, with smoother filmic easing instead of a linear ramp\n2. Fog color desaturates and cools slightly during rain for a moodier, beta-Minecraft-inspired atmosphere\n\n### Post-processing\n\nNew full-screen cinematic grade: subtle vignette, boosted saturation/contrast, cool-shadow/warm-highlight split tone"
		},
